# [[.P.site_title]]

This site is built from Markdown in the `docs/` folder of the `[[.Name]]` repository. Every merge to `main` publishes it.

## How to add a page

1. Add a Markdown file under `docs/`.
2. List it under `nav:` in `mkdocs.yml`.
3. Run `make serve` and check it at <http://localhost:8000>.
4. Open a pull request. The build fails on broken links, so a green check means the page is reachable.

## What belongs here

- **Runbooks**: what to do when something breaks. Start from the [runbook template](runbooks/template.md).
- **Decisions**: why things are the way they are. See the [first record](adr/0001-docs-as-code.md).
- **How-to guides**: one task per page, written for someone doing it for the first time.
